  "content": "<h1><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">在迷宮中 <strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">生存&nbsp;</span></strong></span>&nbsp;</h1><p><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">此模組包在2026年4月10日前不會收到更新&nbsp;</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>嚇！！</p>\n</div><hr><p><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">這個模組包添加了一些「居民」和恐怖的東西，它們會在你於迷宮中求生時試圖獵殺你…祝你好運…你會需要它的</span></span></span></p><hr><p><strong><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">注意：地圖已隨下載附帶，無需另外下載！！</span></span></span></strong></p><hr><p><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fproject%252fmaze-runner-map-5498325%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">在Krypnofite官方PMC頁面下載地圖&nbsp;</a></span></span></strong></span>&nbsp;</p><hr><p><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">[小提示！]世界使用了「實驗性」功能，但你完全可以忽略這個警告！</span></span></strong></span></p><hr><p><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">預告片（有點蠢）</span></span></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><span><span><iframe style=\"width:392px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/AX6VrBQ24Rw?si=5tRgzmu7VfN7CzsO\" width=\"392\" height=\"228\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></span></strong></span></p><hr><p><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">靈感來源：</span></span></span></span></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><span><span><iframe style=\"width:429px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/SrpFX1ljkvk\" width=\"429\" height=\"253\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></span></strong></span></p><hr><p><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">製作人員：Swayle, Krypnofite</span></span></strong></span></p><hr><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/taZ22UZs8a\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">加入Discord以提交錯誤回報</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>忽略世界中的這個警告_______________________________________</p><p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1342653/description_2bc2a4a6-d296-44c9-89ae-61604d27d165.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"493\" height=\"129\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
